@use_credit_card
title: Emergency Fundraising
subtitle: Use the credit card to acquire more resources. Its like free money! +2 Resources
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions = 1; resources += 2; lois_dissent += 5;

Peter takes the credit card while Lois is sleeping and withdraws money. Unfortunately, she is an opponent of Modern Monetary Theory despite Peter's explanations. Peter sleeps on the couch for a few nights

- @root: Return to main

@buy_groceries
title: Go Grocery Shopping
subtitle: Lois can get more groceries in Quahog. Reduces dissent but costs 1 resource.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions = 1; resources -= 1; lois_dissent -= 5; chris_dissent -= 5; meg_dissent -= 5; brian_dissent -= 5; stewie_dissent -= 5; peter_dissent += 5;

Lois goes grocery shopping, everyone's happy to have the kitchen restocked, except Peter, who says 'reliance on imports undermines his ambitions for Autarky.'

- @root: Return to main
